      "value": "The \"Mic Icon Visibility\" setting is broken now too, on top of being very hard to tell the difference between on/off, the icon is always on, even if its set to \"On Activity\" so if you thought it was hard to see, and only wanted to see it while it was active, you can't do that either...",
