      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df3a55f6fa434679f836fa|full_name} There is this hollow icon style in the live version of the game. This is a already active mic that is in use, but lets say this hollow icon would repressent the on mic but not in use and a fully colored mic would be a On mic that is in use. \n\n* Hollow - mic is ON, but not in use.\n\n* Filled - mic is ON and in use. \n\n* Crossed - mic is off. \n\nThere are colors that are colorblind friendly and there is the color blind mode in the setting so it should still work just fine.",
